From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yi Xie <imxieyi@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 5 Sep 2026 20:35:40 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] kosmickrisp: match initial render pass attachment samples

Collect attachment sample counts before setting the Metal 4 render-pass default. Color-only multisample passes otherwise start with a raster sample count of one, leaving their source draw and subsequent resolves invalid.

Add a native GPU regression for single-sample controls, default and maintenance10 command resolves, and dynamic attachment resolves. Cover linear UNORM and sRGB with default, enabled and skipped transfer functions.
---
 src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_cmd_draw.c          |   6 +-
 src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/meson.build            |  20 +
 .../vulkan/tests/test_maintenance10_resolve.c | 484 ++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 508 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/tests/test_maintenance10_resolve.c

diff --git a/src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_cmd_draw.c b/src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_cmd_draw.c
index 919b4245cb27ab6d958ef47c193fb364427c7aa5..2e01607f9b38b001da2bc8d82fae20a427b0614d 100644
--- a/src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_cmd_draw.c
+++ b/src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_cmd_draw.c
@@ -391,8 +391,6 @@ kk_CmdBeginRendering(VkCommandBuffer commandBuffer,
       pass_descriptor, framebuffer_extent.width);
    mtl_render_pass_descriptor_set_render_target_height(
       pass_descriptor, framebuffer_extent.height);
-   mtl_render_pass_descriptor_set_default_raster_sample_count(
-      pass_descriptor, 1u);
 
    /* Check if we are rendering to the whole framebuffer. Required to understand
     * if we need to load to avoid clearing all attachment when loading.
@@ -432,6 +430,10 @@ kk_CmdBeginRendering(VkCommandBuffer commandBuffer,
    kk_set_depth_stencil_attachments(
       pass_descriptor, render, render->bound_attachments,
       force_attachment_load);
+   /* Metal 4 also uses this count for color-only passes. Set it after
+    * collecting attachment samples, before starting the initial encoder. */
+   mtl_render_pass_descriptor_set_default_raster_sample_count(
+      pass_descriptor, MAX2(render->samples, 1u));
 
    /* Render targets are always arrays */
    mtl_render_pass_descriptor_set_render_target_array_length(
